"While the feed tab is open it checks for new posts about once a minute "
"(paused when the tab is hidden); turn this off to stop those background "
"checks entirely. Developers can tune the cadence with the "
"buddynext_feed_new_count_interval filter."
msgstr ""
"Affiche une pilule « nouvelles publications » sur le flux d'activité lorsque "
"de nouvelles publications arrivent. Lorsque l'onglet du flux est ouvert, il "
"vérifie les nouvelles publications environ une fois par minute (suspendu "
"lorsque l'onglet est masqué) ; désactive cela pour arrêter complètement ces "
"vérifications en arrière-plan. Les développeurs peuvent ajuster le rythme "
"avec le filtre buddynext_feed_new_count_interval."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1026
msgid "Post edit window (minutes)"
msgstr "Fenêtre d'édition des publications (minutes)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1029
msgid ""
"How many minutes after posting a member can edit their post. Set to 0 for no "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"Combien de minutes après la publication un membre peut modifier sa "
"publication. Définis sur 0 pour pas de limite."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1049
msgid "Ask for a note when connecting"
msgstr "Demander une note lors de la connexion"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1052
msgid ""
"Off (default): one click sends the connection request, like Facebook. On: "
"the member is asked to add a short note with their request, like LinkedIn - "
"and that note is delivered to the recipient as a direct-message request so "
"they can decide whether to engage before accepting."
msgstr ""
"Désactivé (par défaut) : un clic envoie la demande de connexion, comme "
"Facebook. Activé : le membre est invité à ajouter une courte note à sa "
"demande, comme LinkedIn - et cette note est livrée au destinataire comme une "
"demande de message direct pour qu'il puisse décider s'il veut s'engager "
"avant d'accepter."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1076
msgid ""
"Choose which reactions members can use on posts and comments. At least one "
"is always kept."
msgstr ""
"Choisis quelles réactions les membres peuvent utiliser sur les publications "
"et les commentaires. Au moins une est toujours conservée."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1079
msgid ""
"Reactions are turned off under Platform → Features. Enable the Reactions "
"feature there to choose which emoji members can use."
msgstr ""
"Les réactions sont désactivées sous Plateforme → Fonctionnalités. Active la "
"fonctionnalité Réactions pour choisir quel emoji les membres peuvent "
"utiliser."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1113
msgid "Creation & limits"
msgstr "Création et limites"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1119
msgid "Who can create spaces"
msgstr "Qui peut créer des Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1122
msgid "Any member"
msgstr "N'importe quel membre"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1125
msgid ""
"Restricting to admins prevents members from creating unmoderated spaces."
msgstr ""
"Restreindre aux admins empêche les membres de créer des Space non modérés."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1132
msgid "Max spaces per member"
msgstr "Nombre maximum de Space par membre"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1134
msgid ""
"Maximum number of spaces a single member can create. Set to 0 for no limit. "
"Admins are exempt."
msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum de Space qu'un seul membre peut créer. Définis sur 0 pour pas "
"de limite. Les admins sont exonérés."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1141
msgid "Allow sub-spaces"
msgstr "Permettre les sous-Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1144
msgid ""
"Let space owners create spaces nested inside their own. Turn off to keep "
"every space top-level."
msgstr ""
"Permettre aux propriétaires de Space de créer des Space imbriqués dans les "
"leurs. Désactive pour garder chaque Space au niveau supérieur."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1151
msgid "Max sub-spaces per space"
msgstr "Nombre maximum de sous-Space par Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1153
msgid ""
"Maximum number of sub-spaces a space owner can create inside their space. "
"Set to 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum de sous-Space qu'un propriétaire de Space peut créer dans son "
"Space. Définis sur 0 pour pas de limite."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1160
msgid "New-space defaults"
msgstr "Valeurs par défaut du nouveau Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1166
msgid "Default visibility for new spaces"
msgstr "Visibilité par défaut pour les nouveaux Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1175
msgid ""
"The visibility a space starts with when created. Owners can still change it "
"per space."
msgstr ""
"La visibilité avec laquelle un Space commence lorsqu'il est créé. Les "
"propriétaires peuvent toujours la modifier par Space."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1182
msgid "Default category for new spaces"
msgstr "Catégorie par défaut pour les nouveaux Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1195
msgid ""
"New spaces without a chosen category are filed here. Manage the list under "
"Spaces → Directory → Categories."
msgstr ""
"Les nouveaux Space sans catégorie choisie sont classés ici. Gérer la liste "
"sous Space → Répertoire → Catégories."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1212
msgid "Post Approval (Pre-Moderation)"
msgstr "Approbation des publications (pré-modération)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1218
msgid "Hold posts for approval"
msgstr "Conserver les publications pour approbation"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1221
msgid "Off — every member posts instantly (recommended)"
msgstr "Désactivé — chaque membre publie instantanément (recommandé)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1222
msgid "New members only — hold their first posts until approved"
msgstr ""
"Nouveaux membres uniquement — conserver leurs premières publications jusqu'à "
"approbation"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1223
msgid "Posts with links — hold anything containing a URL"
msgstr "Publications avec liens — conserver tout ce qui contient une URL"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1224
msgid "Everything — hold every post until a moderator approves"
msgstr ""
"Tout — conserver chaque publication jusqu'à ce qu'un modérateur l'approuve"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1226
msgid ""
"Held posts wait in the Moderation > Pending queue and never appear in feeds "
"until approved. Off by default — a community grows by welcoming people, so "
"only turn this up if you start seeing spam. Admins and moderators are never "
"held."
msgstr ""
"Les publications retenues attendent dans la file d'attente Modération > En "
"attente et n'apparaissent jamais dans les flux tant qu'elles ne sont pas "
"approuvées. Désactivé par défaut — une communauté se développe en "
"accueillant les gens, alors n'active cela que si tu commences à voir du "
"spam. Les admins et modérateurs ne sont jamais retenus."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1233
msgid "New-member posts to review"
msgstr "Publications de nouveaux membres à examiner"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1236
msgid ""
"When holding \"New members only\", review this many of a member's first "
"posts before they post freely. Used only by the New members mode."
msgstr ""
"Lors de la conservation « Nouveaux membres uniquement », examine ce nombre "
"de premières publications d'un membre avant qu'il n'affiche librement. "
"Utilisé uniquement par le mode Nouveaux membres."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1243
msgid "Auto-Moderation Thresholds"
msgstr "Seuils de modération automatique"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1249
msgid "Auto-hide after N reports"
msgstr "Masquage automatique après N signalements"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1252
msgid ""
"Content is hidden automatically once it reaches this number of reports. "
"Reviewable in the moderation queue."
msgstr ""
"Le contenu est automatiquement masqué une fois qu'il atteint ce nombre de "
"signalements. Révisable dans la file d'attente de modération."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1259
msgid "Queue alert threshold"
msgstr "Seuil d'alerte de la file d'attente"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1262
msgid ""
"Send a daily email to admins when the moderation queue exceeds this many "
"unreviewed items. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Envoie un e-mail quotidien aux admins lorsque la file d'attente de "
"modération dépasse ce nombre d'éléments non examinés. Définis sur 0 pour "
"désactiver."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1269
msgid "Strike System"
msgstr "Système de coups"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1275
msgid "Strikes before warning"
msgstr "Coups avant avertissement"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1278
msgid "A warning email is sent to the member after this many active strikes."
msgstr ""
"Un e-mail d'avertissement est envoyé au membre après ce nombre de coups "
"actifs."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1285
msgid "Strikes before suspension"
msgstr "Coups avant suspension"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1288
msgid "The member is automatically suspended after this many active strikes."
msgstr ""
"Le membre est automatiquement suspendu après ce nombre de coups actifs."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1295
msgid "Strikes before permanent ban"
msgstr "Coups avant ban permanent"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1298
msgid ""
"The member is permanently banned after this many lifetime strikes. Set to 0 "
"to disable automatic permanent bans."
msgstr ""
"Le membre est définitivement interdit après ce nombre de coups à vie. "
"Définis sur 0 pour désactiver les bans permanents automatiques."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1305
msgid "Content Safeguards"
msgstr "Mesures de sécurité du contenu"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1311 includes/Spaces/CoreSpaceFields.php:139
#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-moderation.php:78
msgid "Banned words"
msgstr "Mots interdits"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1312
msgid ""
"One word or phrase per line. Posts containing any of these are rejected. "
"Case-insensitive substring match."
msgstr ""
"Un mot ou une phrase par ligne. Les publications contenant l'un de ceux-ci "
"sont rejetées. Correspondance de sous-chaîne insensible à la casse."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1319
msgid "Banned hashtags"
msgstr "Hashtags interdits"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1320
msgid ""
"One hashtag per line (without the # sign). Posts using these tags are "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"Un hashtag par ligne (sans le signe #). Les publications utilisant ces "
"balises sont rejetées."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1327
msgid "Blocked link domains"
msgstr "Domaines de lien bloqués"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1328
msgid ""
"One domain per line (e.g. spam.example.com). Posts linking to these domains "
"are rejected."
msgstr ""
"Un domaine par ligne (par ex. spam.exemple.com). Les publications se liant à "
"ces domaines sont rejetées."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1335
msgid "Blocked IP addresses"
msgstr "Adresses IP bloquées"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1337
msgid ""
"One IP address per line (IPv4 or IPv6). These addresses cannot sign in, "
"register, post, or comment - including on accounts they already hold. Your "
"own address cannot be added. Invalid entries are dropped on save."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1344
msgid "Post rate limit (per minute)"
msgstr "Limite de débit des publications (par minute)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1347
msgid ""
"Maximum number of posts a member can create per minute. Set to 0 to disable "
"rate limiting."
msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum de publications qu'un membre peut créer par minute. Définis "
"sur 0 pour désactiver la limitation du débit."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1354
msgid "Comment rate limit (per minute)"
msgstr "Limite de débit des commentaires (par minute)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1357
msgid ""
"Maximum number of comments a member can post per minute. Set to 0 to disable "
"rate limiting."
msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum de commentaires qu'un membre peut publier par minute. Définis "
"sur 0 pour désactiver la limitation du débit."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1364
msgid "Duplicate post window (minutes)"
msgstr "Fenêtre de publication dupliquée (minutes)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1367
msgid ""
"Hold a post for review when the member has already posted identical content "
"within this many minutes. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Retiens une publication pour examen lorsque le membre a déjà publié un "
"contenu identique dans ce nombre de minutes. Définis sur 0 pour désactiver."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1374
msgid "New member review threshold"
msgstr "Seuil d'examen des nouveaux membres"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1377
msgid ""
"Posts by members with fewer than this many published posts are held for "
"review. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Les publications de membres ayant moins de ce nombre de publications "
"publiées sont retenues pour examen. Définis sur 0 pour désactiver."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1394
msgid "Default Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Préférences de notification par défaut"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1400
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationMessageService.php:566
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationPrefCatalogue.php:58
#: includes/Onboarding/SetupWizard.php:841
msgid "New follower"
msgstr "Nouveau suivi"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1402
msgid "Notify users by default when someone follows them."
msgstr "Notifie les utilisateurs par défaut lorsque quelqu'un les suit."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1409
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationMessageService.php:576
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationPrefCatalogue.php:74
#: templates/parts/profile/people-panel.php:64
msgid "Connection request"
msgid_plural "Connection requests"
msgstr[0] "Demande de connexion"
msgstr[1] "Demandes de connexion"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1411
msgid "Notify users by default when they receive a connection request."
msgstr ""
"Notifie les utilisateurs par défaut lorsqu'ils reçoivent une demande de "
"connexion."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1418
msgid "Reaction on post"
msgstr "Réaction sur la publication"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1420
msgid "Notify users by default when someone reacts to their post."
msgstr ""
"Notifie les utilisateurs par défaut lorsque quelqu'un réagit à leur "
"publication."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1427
msgid "Comment on post"
msgstr "Commentaire sur la publication"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1429
msgid "Notify users by default when someone comments on their post."
msgstr ""
"Notifie les utilisateurs par défaut lorsque quelqu'un commente leur "
"publication."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1436
msgid "@mention in post or comment"
msgstr "@mention dans la publication ou le commentaire"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1438
msgid "Notify users by default when they are mentioned."
msgstr "Notifie les utilisateurs par défaut lorsqu'ils sont mentionnés."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1445
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationMessageService.php:621
msgid "New space member"
msgstr "Nouveau membre du Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1447
msgid "Notify space owners by default when someone joins their space."
msgstr ""
"Notifier les propriétaires de Space par défaut quand quelqu'un rejoint leur "
"Space."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1454
msgid "Email Digest"
msgstr "Résumé par email"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1460
msgid "Digest frequency"
msgstr "Fréquence du résumé"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1463
msgid "Disabled — no digest emails"
msgstr "Désactivé — aucun email de résumé"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1464 templates/notifications/prefs.php:72
msgid "Daily"
msgstr "Quotidien"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1465 templates/notifications/prefs.php:73
msgid "Weekly"
msgstr "Hebdomadaire"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1467
msgid ""
"How often BuddyNext sends a digest of unread notifications. Individual users "
"can opt out."
msgstr ""
"À quelle fréquence BuddyNext envoie un résumé de tes notifications non lues. "
"Les utilisateurs individuels peuvent refuser."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1474
msgid "Admin Alerts"
msgstr "Alertes administrateur"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1480
msgid "Admin alert email"
msgstr "Email d'alerte administrateur"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1483
msgid ""
"Receives daily alerts when the moderation queue or pending registration "
"count is high. Defaults to WordPress admin email."
msgstr ""
"Reçoit des alertes quotidiennes quand la file de modération ou le nombre "
"d'inscriptions en attente est élevé. Par défaut : l'email administrateur "
"WordPress."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1500
msgid "Sender Identity"
msgstr "Identité de l'expéditeur"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1506
msgid "From name"
msgstr "Nom de l'expéditeur"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1508
msgid ""
"Display name shown in the \"From:\" field of all community emails. Defaults "
"to your site name."
msgstr ""
"Nom d'affichage qui s'affiche dans le champ « De : » de tous les emails de "
"la communauté. Par défaut : le nom de ton site."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1515
msgid "From address"
msgstr "Adresse d'expéditeur"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1518
msgid ""
"Sending address for all BuddyNext system emails. Defaults to your admin "
"email; use a verified domain for best deliverability."
msgstr ""
"Adresse d'envoi pour tous les emails système de BuddyNext. Par défaut : ton "
"email administrateur ; utilise un domaine vérifié pour une meilleure "
"délivrabilité."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1525
msgid "Reply-To address"
msgstr "Adresse de réponse"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1527
msgid ""
"Optional. If set, replies to community emails go here instead of the From "
"address. Applied to every BuddyNext email."
msgstr ""
"Facultatif. Si tu la définis, les réponses aux emails de la communauté vont "
"ici au lieu de l'adresse d'expédition. S'applique à tous les emails de "
"BuddyNext."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1534
msgid "Email Footer"
msgstr "Pied de page des emails"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1540
msgid "Footer text"
msgstr "Texte du pied de page"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1541
msgid ""
"Appended to the bottom of every BuddyNext email. Plain text, plus the "
"placeholders {{site_name}}, {{site_url}}, and {{current_year}}."
msgstr ""
"Ajouté au bas de chaque email de BuddyNext. Texte brut, plus les "
"placeholders {{site_name}}, {{site_url}} et {{current_year}}."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1564 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2317
msgid "Registration Settings"
msgstr "Paramètres d'inscription"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1570 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2332
msgid "Registration Mode"
msgstr "Mode d'inscription"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1571 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2340
msgid "Controls who can create a new account on your community."
msgstr "Contrôle qui peut créer un nouveau compte sur ta communauté."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1578 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2385
#: includes/Onboarding/SetupWizard.php:625
msgid "Require email verification"
msgstr "Exiger la vérification par e-mail"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1579
msgid ""
"Ask new members to confirm their email address. Choose how strictly it is "
"enforced below."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1586 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2396
msgid "How strictly to enforce verification"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1587
msgid ""
"Restricted (recommended): members can look around but cannot post or comment "
"until they confirm. Full: they cannot use the community at all until they "
"confirm."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1594 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2351
msgid "Require members to accept your terms"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1595 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2352
msgid "Shows a consent checkbox on every sign-up route. On by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1602 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2362
msgid "Ask new members for their name"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1603 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2363
msgid ""
"On by default. This is the name other members see. Turn it off only if your "
"community wants handles rather than names."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1610 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2369
msgid "Let members choose their own username"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1611 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2370
msgid ""
"Off by default: a username is generated from their email so nobody has to "
"invent one to join, and they can change it later in Settings. Turn this on "
"to ask for one at sign-up."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1618 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2376
msgid "Also allow the WordPress sign-up form"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1619 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2377
msgid ""
"Off by default: wp-login.php sign-ups are sent to your BuddyNext sign-up "
"page instead. Turn this on if another plugin relies on the WordPress form. "
"It is protected by your settings either way."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1626 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2417
msgid "Login &amp; Sign-up Panel"
msgstr "Panneau Connexion &amp; Inscription"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1632 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2421
msgid "Show the branding panel"
msgstr "Afficher le panneau de marque"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1633
msgid "Displays a branded side panel next to the login and sign-up forms."
msgstr ""
"Affiche un panneau latéral de marque à côté des formulaires de connexion et "
"d'inscription."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1640 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2431
msgid "Panel heading"
msgstr "En-tête du panneau"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1647 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2438
msgid "Panel tagline"
msgstr "Ligne de sous-titre du panneau"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1654 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2446
msgid "Featured quote"
msgstr "Citation en vedette"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1661 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2454
msgid "Panel banner image URL"
msgstr "URL de l'image de bannière du panneau"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1668 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2461
msgid "Sign-up form subtitle"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1669
msgid "Shown under \"Join the community\" on the sign-up form."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1676 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2468
msgid "Legal Pages"
msgstr "Pages légales"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1682 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2480
msgid "Terms of Service page"
msgstr "Page Conditions d'utilisation"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1684
msgid "Linked from the sign-up consent line."
msgstr "Lié à partir de la ligne de consentement d'inscription."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1691 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2515
msgid "Spam &amp; Abuse Protection"
msgstr "Protection contre le spam &amp; les abus"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1697 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2524
msgid "Require two-factor authentication"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1698
msgid ""
"Members are always free to switch two-factor on themselves. This makes it "
"mandatory for the roles you choose."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1705 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2537
msgid "Protect the sign-up form"
msgstr "Protéger le formulaire d'inscription"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1706
msgid "In-house rate limit, honeypot, and time-trap. On by default."
msgstr ""
"Limite de débit interne, pot de miel et piège temporel. Activé par défaut."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1713 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2544
msgid "Show a human-verification question"
msgstr "Afficher une question de vérification humaine"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1714
msgid "Adds an accessible verification question to the sign-up form."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute une question de vérification accessible au formulaire d'inscription."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1721 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2551
msgid "Sign-ups per hour per IP"
msgstr "Inscriptions par heure par IP"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1724
msgid "Maximum sign-up attempts from one IP per hour. 0 disables the limit."
msgstr ""
"Nombre maximum de tentatives d'inscription à partir d'une adresse IP par "
"heure. 0 désactive la limite."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1731 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2560
msgid "Access Restrictions"
msgstr "Restrictions d'accès"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1737 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2564
msgid "Allowed email domains"
msgstr "Domaines de messagerie autorisés"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1738
msgid "One domain per line. When set, only these domains can register."
msgstr ""
"Un domaine par ligne. Quand c'est défini, seuls ces domaines peuvent "
"s'enregistrer."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1745 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2579
msgid "Blocked email domains"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1746
msgid "One domain per line. Addresses from these domains cannot register."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1753 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2611
msgid "Redirects"
msgstr "Redirections"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1759 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2615
msgid "After login"
msgstr "Après la connexion"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1760
msgid "Where members go after logging in. Blank = activity feed."
msgstr "Où les membres vont après s'être connectés. Vide = fil d'activité."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1767 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2622
msgid "After logout"
msgstr "Après la déconnexion"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1768
msgid "Where members go after logging out. Blank = the login page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1775 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2631
msgid "After onboarding"
msgstr "Après l'intégration"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1776
msgid "Where new members go after onboarding. Blank = their profile."
msgstr "Où les nouveaux membres vont après l'onboarding. Vide = leur profil."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1783 includes/Admin/Settings.php:1792
#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:2639
msgid "Social Login"
